   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Chapter 11. Same seed, two passes: without LoRA and with LoRA (strength 0.8).\nLoRA: sd_xl_offset_example-lora_1.0 from the official SDXL repository (Open RAIL++-M) -\ndeeper blacks and stronger contrast. File -> ComfyUI/models/loras.\nAlways compare with the no-LoRA version, otherwise you don't know what it did.\n\nLICENCES (as of 26 Oct 2026 - check before selling):\n- SDXL base 1.0: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M - commercial use allowed, with a list of prohibited uses.\nNot legal advice."
   ],
